      "clause": "6",
      "title": "Workmanship",
      "text": "6. Workmanship  and Finish -  All the four edges of the door shutter shall be square. The shutter shall be free from twist or warp in its plane. Both faces of door shutter shall be sanded to a smooth even texture.",
